{"id":"c9572172-c268-4364-9386-9572ca34ebc7","createdAt":"2026-10-25T05:16:43.811Z","batchId":"comparison_deepseek-v4.1-flash-opencode-go_high","approach":"html","modelId":"deepseek-v4.1-flash-opencode-go","settings":{"effort":"high"},"presetId":"comparison","prompt":"A side-by-side comparison of these laptops that helps pick one.","fixtureId":"products","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".\n\nDATA (build the UI around this content):\n[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Aero 14\",\n    \"tagline\": \"Light, bright, long-lasting\",\n    \"price\": 1299,\n    \"weightKg\": 1.2,\n    \"batteryH\": 18,\n    \"screen\": \"14\\\" OLED\",\n    \"cpu\": \"8-core, 15 W\",\n    \"ramGb\": 16,\n    \"storageGb\": 512,\n    \"ports\": [\n      \"2x USB-C\",\n      \"HDMI\",\n      \"headphone\"\n    ],\n    \"rating\": 4.6,\n    \"reviews\": 1840,\n    \"pros\": [\n      \"Gorgeous OLED panel\",\n      \"Great battery\",\n      \"Quiet under load\"\n    ],\n    \"cons\": [\n      \"Soldered RAM\",\n      \"Glossy screen\"\n    ],\n    \"bestFor\": \"Travel and everyday work\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Forge 16\",\n    \"tagline\": \"Desktop power on the go\",\n    \"price\": 1899,\n    \"weightKg\": 2.1,\n    \"batteryH\": 9,\n    \"screen\": \"16\\\" IPS 165Hz\",\n    \"cpu\": \"16-core, 55 W\",\n    \"ramGb\": 32,\n    \"storageGb\": 1024,\n    \"ports\": [\n      \"2x USB-C\",\n      \"3x USB-A\",\n      \"HDMI\",\n      \"Ethernet\",\n      \"SD card\"\n    ],\n    \"rating\": 4.4,\n    \"reviews\": 960,\n    \"pros\": [\n      \"Fastest of the three\",\n      \"Upgradeable RAM and SSD\",\n      \"Full port selection\"\n    ],\n    \"cons\": [\n      \"Heavy\",\n      \"Fans are audible\"\n    ],\n    \"bestFor\": \"Video editing, 3D and gaming\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Nimbus 13\",\n    \"tagline\": \"Everything you need, for less\",\n    \"price\": 999,\n    \"weightKg\": 1,\n    \"batteryH\": 22,\n    \"screen\": \"13\\\" IPS\",\n    \"cpu\": \"6-core, 15 W\",\n    \"ramGb\": 16,\n    \"storageGb\": 256,\n    \"ports\": [\n      \"2x USB-C\",\n      \"headphone\"\n    ],\n    \"rating\": 4.2,\n    \"reviews\": 2310,\n    \"pros\": [\n      \"Lightest\",\n      \"Best battery life\",\n      \"Lowest price\"\n    ],\n    \"cons\": [\n      \"Dimmer screen\",\n      \"Small SSD\"\n    ],\n    \"bestFor\": \"Students and light office work\"\n  }\n]","systemHash":"dcc43620444bd5561aa7a57e09f50adaace10b9cc1a0c5f2f824f41f6ed0f15b","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<style>\n  .pick-card { height: 100%; }\n  .pick-card .pick-cta { margin-top: auto; }\n  .pick-card.is-picked { outline: 2px solid #6366f1; outline-offset: 2px; }\n  #priorities { flex-wrap: wrap; }\n  .chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .35rem; }\n  .pros-cons ul { margin: .25rem 0 0; padding-left: 1.1rem; }\n  .pros-cons li + li { margin-top: .25rem; }\n  .table-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }\n  #specTable.no-winners .winner { display: none; }\n  #specs { scroll-margin-top: 1rem; }\n  #specs > .row { flex-wrap: wrap; }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n\n  <header class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <div class=\"row between center\">\n      <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Laptop buying guide</span>\n      <span class=\"small muted\">Updated 25 October 2026 · Prices in USD</span>\n    </div>\n    <h1>Aero 14 vs Forge 16 vs Nimbus 13</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Three laptops, three price points, three very different sets of compromises. One is a featherweight OLED ultraportable, one is a 16-core desktop replacement, and one undercuts both while lasting longest. Here is everything that separates them — and which one fits the way you work.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"alert stack gap-sm\">\n    <div class=\"row between center gap-sm\">\n      <strong>Quick verdict</strong>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">$999–$1,899</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"small\"><strong>Aero 14</strong> is the best all-rounder: 1.2 kg, 18 hours and an OLED screen for $1,299. <strong>Forge 16</strong> is the performance choice — 16 cores, 32 GB and 1 TB — but it weighs 2.1 kg and runs for 9 hours. <strong>Nimbus 13</strong> wins on price ($999), weight (1.0 kg) and battery (22 h), with a smaller SSD and a dimmer screen.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <div>\n      <h2>At a glance</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted small\">Two of the three start at 16 GB of memory, but their priorities could hardly be more different.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3 gap-sm\">\n\n      <article class=\"card stack gap-sm pick-card\" data-model=\"Aero 14\">\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <span class=\"badge\">Best all-rounder</span>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">★ 4.6 (1,840)</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Aero 14</h3>\n          <p class=\"card-desc\">Light, bright, long-lasting</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"stat-label\">Price</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-value\">$1,299</div>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">+$300 vs Nimbus</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"small\">14\" OLED · 8-core, 15 W<br>16 GB RAM · 512 GB SSD<br>1.2 kg · 18 h battery</p>\n        <p class=\"small\"><strong>Best for:</strong> Travel and everyday work</p>\n        <div class=\"chips\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">OLED display</span>\n          <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Quiet under load</span>\n        </div>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm btn-block pick-cta\" href=\"#specs\">Compare all specs</a>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card stack gap-sm pick-card\" data-model=\"Forge 16\">\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Fastest here</span>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">★ 4.4 (960)</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Forge 16</h3>\n          <p class=\"card-desc\">Desktop power on the go</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"stat-label\">Price</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-value\">$1,899</div>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">+$900 vs Nimbus</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"small\">16\" IPS 165Hz · 16-core, 55 W<br>32 GB RAM · 1 TB SSD<br>2.1 kg · 9 h battery</p>\n        <p class=\"small\"><strong>Best for:</strong> Video editing, 3D and gaming</p>\n        <div class=\"chips\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Upgradeable RAM</span>\n          <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">8 ports</span>\n        </div>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm btn-block pick-cta\" href=\"#specs\">Compare all specs</a>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card stack gap-sm pick-card\" data-model=\"Nimbus 13\">\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Best value</span>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">★ 4.2 (2,310)</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Nimbus 13</h3>\n          <p class=\"card-desc\">Everything you need, for less</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"stat-label\">Price</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-value\">$999</div>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"small up\">Lowest price</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"small\">13\" IPS · 6-core, 15 W<br>16 GB RAM · 256 GB SSD<br>1.0 kg · 22 h battery</p>\n        <p class=\"small\"><strong>Best for:</strong> Students and light office work</p>\n        <div class=\"chips\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">22 h battery</span>\n          <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">1.0 kg</span>\n        </div>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm btn-block pick-cta\" href=\"#specs\">Compare all specs</a>\n      </article>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <div>\n      <h2>Pick by priority</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted small\">Choose what you care about most and the recommendation updates. The matching card above is outlined.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <div id=\"priorities\" class=\"row gap-sm\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Choose a priority\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-sm\" data-priority=\"battery\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Battery life</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\" data-priority=\"portability\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Portability</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\" data-priority=\"performance\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Performance</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\" data-priority=\"price\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Price</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\" data-priority=\"storage\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Storage</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm\" data-priority=\"display\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Display</button>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"alert stack gap-sm\" id=\"pickPanel\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n        <div class=\"row between center gap-sm\">\n          <div class=\"row center gap-sm\">\n            <span class=\"badge\" id=\"pickBadge\">Longest battery</span>\n            <strong id=\"pickName\">Nimbus 13</strong>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"stat-value\" id=\"pickMetric\">22 h</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"small\" id=\"pickText\">Nimbus 13 runs for 22 hours — 4 hours longer than Aero 14 and 13 hours longer than Forge 16. It is also the lightest model here; the trade-off is a dimmer 13-inch IPS screen and a 256 GB SSD.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <div>\n      <h2>How the numbers compare</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted small\">Four figures do most of the deciding. Each chart uses its own scale, so read the differences within a chart rather than comparing bar heights across charts.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid cols-2 gap-lg\">\n      <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Battery life (hours)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":18},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":9},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":22}]}'></div>\n      <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Price (USD)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":1299},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":1899},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":999}]}'></div>\n      <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Weight (kg)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":1.2},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":2.1},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":1.0}]}'></div>\n      <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Storage (GB)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":512},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":1024},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":256}]}'></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stack gap-sm\" id=\"specs\">\n    <div class=\"row between center gap-sm\">\n      <div>\n        <h2>Side-by-side specifications</h2>\n        <p class=\"muted small\">Badges mark the strongest value in each row. Uncheck to read the raw figures.</p>\n      </div>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"winnerToggle\" checked> Highlight winners</label>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"table-scroll\">\n      <table id=\"specTable\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"col\">Specification</th>\n            <th scope=\"col\">Aero 14</th>\n            <th scope=\"col\">Forge 16</th>\n            <th scope=\"col\">Nimbus 13</th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Price</th>\n            <td class=\"num\">$1,299</td>\n            <td class=\"num\">$1,899</td>\n            <td class=\"num\">$999 <span class=\"winner badge badge-secondary\">Lowest</span></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Price vs Nimbus 13</th>\n            <td class=\"num\">+$300</td>\n            <td class=\"num\">+$900</td>\n            <td class=\"num\">—</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Weight</th>\n            <td class=\"num\">1.2 kg</td>\n            <td class=\"num\">2.1 kg</td>\n            <td class=\"num\">1.0 kg <span class=\"winner badge badge-secondary\">Lightest</span></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Battery life</th>\n            <td class=\"num\">18 h</td>\n            <td class=\"num\">9 h</td>\n            <td class=\"num\">22 h <span class=\"winner badge badge-secondary\">Longest</span></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Screen</th>\n            <td class=\"num\">14\" OLED <span class=\"winner badge badge-secondary\">OLED</span></td>\n            <td class=\"num\">16\" IPS 165Hz</td>\n            <td class=\"num\">13\" IPS</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Processor</th>\n            <td>8-core, 15 W</td>\n            <td>16-core, 55 W <span class=\"winner badge badge-secondary\">Fastest</span></td>\n            <td>6-core, 15 W</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Memory</th>\n            <td>16 GB <span class=\"small muted\">(soldered)</span></td>\n            <td>32 GB <span class=\"small muted\">(upgradeable)</span> <span class=\"winner badge badge-secondary\">Most</span></td>\n            <td>16 GB</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Storage</th>\n            <td class=\"num\">512 GB</td>\n            <td class=\"num\">1 TB <span class=\"winner badge badge-secondary\">Largest</span></td>\n            <td class=\"num\">256 GB</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Ports</th>\n            <td>2x USB-C, HDMI, headphone <span class=\"small muted\">(4)</span></td>\n            <td>2x USB-C, 3x USB-A, HDMI, Ethernet, SD card <span class=\"winner badge badge-secondary\">Most</span> <span class=\"small muted\">(8)</span></td>\n            <td>2x USB-C, headphone <span class=\"small muted\">(3)</span></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Owner rating</th>\n            <td class=\"num\">★ 4.6 <span class=\"winner badge badge-secondary\">Highest</span></td>\n            <td class=\"num\">★ 4.4</td>\n            <td class=\"num\">★ 4.2</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Reviews</th>\n            <td class=\"num\">1,840</td>\n            <td class=\"num\">960</td>\n            <td class=\"num\">2,310 <span class=\"winner badge badge-secondary\">Most</span></td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\">Best for</th>\n            <td>Travel and everyday work</td>\n            <td>Video editing, 3D and gaming</td>\n            <td>Students and light office work</td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <div>\n      <h2>Pros and cons, per model</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted small\">The things owners consistently praise — and the compromises you should accept before buying.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3 gap-sm\">\n\n      <article class=\"card stack gap-sm pros-cons\">\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <h3>Aero 14</h3>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">$1,299</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"small up\"><strong>Pros</strong></p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Gorgeous OLED panel</li>\n            <li>Great battery</li>\n            <li>Quiet under load</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"small down\"><strong>Cons</strong></p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Soldered RAM</li>\n            <li>Glossy screen</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card stack gap-sm pros-cons\">\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <h3>Forge 16</h3>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">$1,899</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"small up\"><strong>Pros</strong></p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Fastest of the three</li>\n            <li>Upgradeable RAM and SSD</li>\n            <li>Full port selection</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"small down\"><strong>Cons</strong></p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Heavy</li>\n            <li>Fans are audible</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card stack gap-sm pros-cons\">\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <h3>Nimbus 13</h3>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">$999</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"small up\"><strong>Pros</strong></p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Lightest</li>\n            <li>Best battery life</li>\n            <li>Lowest price</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <p class=\"small down\"><strong>Cons</strong></p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Dimmer screen</li>\n            <li>Small SSD</li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <div>\n      <h2>Which one fits you?</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted small\">Match the machine to the job you do most, then check the trade-off you can live with.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3 gap-sm\">\n\n      <article class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <span class=\"badge\">Travel & everyday</span>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">$1,299</span>\n        </div>\n        <h3>Aero 14</h3>\n        <p class=\"small\">The easiest one to live with: 1.2 kg, 18 hours away from the charger and an OLED panel owners single out. It is quiet under load, too. Buy the storage you need up front — the 16 GB of RAM is soldered.</p>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">1.2 kg · 18 h · 14\" OLED · 8-core, 15 W</p>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Creative & gaming</span>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">$1,899</span>\n        </div>\n        <h3>Forge 16</h3>\n        <p class=\"small\">For video editing, 3D work and gaming, the 16-core 55 W CPU, 32 GB of RAM, 1 TB SSD and 165 Hz screen are in a different class. It is the only model with upgradeable memory and storage. Expect 2.1 kg and audible fans.</p>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">2.1 kg · 9 h · 16\" 165Hz · 16-core, 55 W</p>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Study & office</span>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">$999</span>\n        </div>\n        <h3>Nimbus 13</h3>\n        <p class=\"small\">The lowest price, the lightest chassis and the longest battery make this a strong student or office machine. The compromises are a 256 GB SSD and a dimmer 13-inch IPS panel; if either is a dealbreaker, Aero 14 is the next step up.</p>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">1.0 kg · 22 h · 13\" IPS · 6-core, 15 W</p>\n      </article>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <p class=\"small muted\">Prices are in USD before tax. Battery figures are manufacturer ratings and vary with use. Owner ratings and review counts are shown as supplied; together the three models account for 5,110 reviews.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var picks = {\n    battery: {\n      name: \"Nimbus 13\",\n      badge: \"Longest battery\",\n      metric: \"22 h\",\n      text: \"Nimbus 13 runs for 22 hours — 4 hours longer than Aero 14 and 13 hours longer than Forge 16. It is also the lightest model here; the trade-off is a dimmer 13-inch IPS screen and a 256 GB SSD.\"\n    },\n    portability: {\n      name: \"Nimbus 13\",\n      badge: \"Lightest\",\n      metric: \"1.0 kg\",\n      text: \"At 1.0 kg, Nimbus 13 is 0.2 kg lighter than Aero 14 and less than half the weight of Forge 16. If you also want an OLED screen, Aero 14 is the better compromise at 1.2 kg.\"\n    },\n    performance: {\n      name: \"Forge 16\",\n      badge: \"Fastest\",\n      metric: \"16-core, 55 W\",\n      text: \"Forge 16 pairs a 16-core, 55 W processor with 32 GB of upgradeable RAM and a 1 TB SSD — twice the memory and storage of the others. The cost is 2.1 kg and just 9 hours of battery.\"\n    },\n    price: {\n      name: \"Nimbus 13\",\n      badge: \"Lowest price\",\n      metric: \"$999\",\n      text: \"Nimbus 13 costs $300 less than Aero 14 and $900 less than Forge 16, yet still has 16 GB of RAM and the longest battery life. The compromises are the 256 GB SSD and the dimmer 13-inch IPS display.\"\n    },\n    storage: {\n      name: \"Forge 16\",\n      badge: \"Largest SSD\",\n      metric: \"1 TB\",\n      text: \"Forge 16 gives you 1 TB — twice Aero 14's 512 GB and four times Nimbus 13's 256 GB — and it is user-upgradeable. Choose Aero 14 if 512 GB is enough and you want a lighter machine.\"\n    },\n    display: {\n      name: \"Aero 14\",\n      badge: \"Best display\",\n      metric: \"14\\\" OLED\",\n      text: \"Aero 14's 14-inch OLED panel is the standout screen of the three, and owners rate the machine 4.6 out of 5 overall. Pick Forge 16 instead if you need a 165 Hz refresh rate for gaming.\"\n    }\n  };\n\n  var buttons = Array.prototype.slice.call(document.querySelectorAll(\"#priorities [data-priority]\"));\n  var badgeEl = document.getElementById(\"pickBadge\");\n  var nameEl = document.getElementById(\"pickName\");\n  var metricEl = document.getElementById(\"pickMetric\");\n  var textEl = document.getElementById(\"pickText\");\n  var cards = Array.prototype.slice.call(document.querySelectorAll(\".pick-card\"));\n\n  function render(key) {\n    var pick = picks[key];\n    if (!pick) return;\n\n    badgeEl.textContent = pick.badge;\n    nameEl.textContent = pick.name;\n    metricEl.textContent = pick.metric;\n    textEl.textContent = pick.text;\n\n    buttons.forEach(function (button) {\n      var active = button.getAttribute(\"data-priority\") === key;\n      button.classList.toggle(\"btn\", active);\n      button.classList.toggle(\"btn-outline\", !active);\n      button.setAttribute(\"aria-pressed\", active ? \"true\" : \"false\");\n    });\n\n    cards.forEach(function (card) {\n      card.classList.toggle(\"is-picked\", card.getAttribute(\"data-model\") === pick.name);\n    });\n  }\n\n  buttons.forEach(function (button) {\n    button.addEventListener(\"click\", function () {\n      render(button.getAttribute(\"data-priority\"));\n    });\n  });\n\n  render(\"battery\");\n\n  var winnerToggle = document.getElementById(\"winnerToggle\");\n  var specTable = document.getElementById(\"specTable\");\n\n  if (winnerToggle && specTable) {\n    winnerToggle.addEventListener(\"change\", function () {\n      specTable.classList.toggle(\"no-winners\", !winnerToggle.checked);\n    });\n  }\n})();\n</script>","deltas":[[103781,"<style>\n  .pick-card { height: 100%; }\n  .pick-card .pick-cta { margin-top: auto; }\n  .pick-card.is-picked { outline: 2px solid #6366f1; outline-offset: 2px; }\n  #priorities { flex-wrap: wrap; }\n  .chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .35rem; }\n  .pros-cons ul { margin: .25rem 0 0; padding-left: 1.1rem; }\n  .pros-cons li + li { margin-top: .25rem; }\n  .table-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }\n  #specTable.no-winners .winner { display: none; }\n  #specs { scroll-margin-top: 1rem; }\n  #specs > .row { flex-wrap: wrap; }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"page stack gap-lg\">\n\n  <header class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <div class=\"row between center\">\n      <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Laptop buying guide</span>\n      <span class=\"small muted\">Updated 25 October 2026 · Prices in USD</span>\n    </div>\n    <h1>Aero 14 vs Forge 16 vs Nimbus 13</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Three laptops, three price points, three very different sets of compromises. One is a featherweight OLED ultraportable, one is a 16-core desktop replacement, and one undercuts both while lasting longest. Here is everything that separates them — and which one fits the way you work.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"alert stack gap-sm\">\n    <div class=\"row between center gap-sm\">\n      <strong>Quick verdict</strong>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">$999–$1,899</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"small\"><strong>Aero 14</strong> is the best all-rounder: 1.2 kg, 18 hours and an OLED screen for $1,299. <strong>Forge 16</strong> is the performance choice — 16 cores, 32 GB and 1 TB — but it weighs 2.1 kg and runs for 9 hours. <strong>Nimbus 13</strong> wins on price ($999), weight (1.0 kg) and battery (22 h), with a smaller SSD and a dimmer screen.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n    <div>\n      <h2>At a glance</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted small\">Two of the three start at 16 GB of memory, but their priorities could hardly be more different.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3 gap-sm\">\n\n      <article class=\"card stack gap-sm pick-card\" data-model=\"Aero 14\">\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <span class=\"badge\">Best all-rounder</span>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">★ 4.6 (1,840)</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Aero 14</h3>\n          <p class=\"card-desc\">Light, bright, long-lasting</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"stat-label\">Price</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-value\">$1,299</div>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">+$300 vs Nimbus</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"small\">14\" OLED · 8-core, 15 W<br>16 GB RAM · 512 GB SSD<br>1.2 kg · 18 h battery</p>\n        <p class=\"small\"><strong>Best for:</strong> Travel and everyday work</p>\n        <div class=\"chips\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">OLED display</span>\n          <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Quiet under load</span>\n        </div>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm btn-block pick-cta\" href=\"#specs\">Compare all specs</a>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card stack gap-sm pick-card\" data-model=\"Forge 16\">\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Fastest here</span>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">★ 4.4 (960)</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <h3>Forge 16</h3>\n          <p class=\"card-desc\">Desktop power on the go</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <div>\n            <div class=\"stat-label\">Price</div>\n            <div class=\"stat-value\">$1,899</div>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"small muted\">+$900 vs Nimbus</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"small\">16\" IPS 165Hz · 16-core, 55 W<br>32 GB RAM · 1 TB SSD<br>2.1 kg · 9 h battery</p>\n        <p class=\"small\"><strong>Best for:</strong> Video editing, 3D and gaming</p>\n        <div class=\"chips\">\n          <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Upgradeable RAM</span>\n          <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">8 ports</span>\n        </div>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-outline btn-sm btn-block pick-cta\" href=\"#specs\">Compare all specs</a>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"card stack gap-sm pick-card\" data-model=\"Nimbus 13\">\n        <di